15,16.6,1988,55,110,26]],"links":[["Mercer County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/north-dakota/mercer-county"],["ARC or PLC in Mercer County","/arc-plc/north-dakota/mercer-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids came in under 90% of normal in October to November in 41 of 75 years on record since 1951. For 2026 so far, the middle sat at 64% of normal in April to May and 66% in June to July. Grid 32212 had its driest year in 2017, at 56% of normal.</p>"}
